# Cottage Cheese Savory Bowl

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1/2 cup [cottage cheese]{ ing="cottage-cheese" }
- [ ] 1/4 cup [cherry tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" }, halved
- [ ] 1/4 cup [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }, diced
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [red onion]{ ing="red-onion" }, diced
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [feta]{ ing="feta" }, crumbled
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] [Salt and black pepper]{ ing="salt-and-black-pepper" }, to taste
- [ ] Fresh [parsley or chives]{ ing="parsley-or-chives" }, chopped

## Recipe

1. Spoon [cottage cheese]{ ing="cottage-cheese" } into a bowl as the base
1. Arrange [tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" }, [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }, and [onion]{ ing="red-onion" } on top
1. Drizzle with [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } and [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
1. Top with [feta]{ ing="feta" }, herbs, and season with salt and [pepper]{ ing="salt-and-black-pepper" }

## Notes

- Swap feta for avocado or add both
- A pinch of red pepper flakes or dried oregano fits well
- Serve with pita or crackers to make it more filling
- Black bean salad or chickpea salad toppings work as a shortcut
